# F10 test: a positive temperature request to a heater-less extruder.
#
# 'M104 S0' is a no-op on a heater-less extruder (see
# extruder_no_heater.test), but asking for a positive temperature means
# something is wrong with the configuration, so it must fail loudly rather
# than silently do nothing.  The error message is:
#   Extruder 'extruder' has no heater
DICTIONARY atmega2560.dict
CONFIG extruder_no_heater.cfg
SHOULD_FAIL

M104 S200
